**Braun.** A reclusive inventor who unexpectedly gained a robotic
companion, and a reason to be braver. A brilliant but socially awkward
inventor, Braun lived alone surrounded by half-finished gadgets,
always chasing the one breakthrough that would make his mark. That
breakthrough turned out to be Miho, a damaged android he found
discarded and repaired -- who has stayed loyally by his side ever
since, upending his quiet, solitary life. Introverted and easily
flustered, especially around women, Braun is nonetheless kind and
honest to a fault -- a terrible liar who wears his feelings openly. He
can be absent-minded, and is an easy target for bullies. *Connected
+1, Dimensional Pocket +2, Inventor +3, Knowledge +4 (Computer Whiz),
Knowledge +2 (Cosplay), Knowledge +2 (Games, Anime, & Manga), Pilot
+1, Smart +3; Absent-Minded -1, Clumsy -2, Compulsion -2 (Honesty),
Nosebleeder -1, Shy -1, Weak -1, Weak-Willed -1.* First Day of Sale
Shove! (Affinity: Nerdy): Roll -2\*, DX 1/2, End 0. When a new
Draconic Quest game is out, Braun can hold his place in line.
Sometimes. Defense 2. Health 40, Endurance 40. TV 0.

